Laking was awarded the [[Queen Elizabeth II Diamond Jubilee Medal]] in 2012, receiving the Lifetime Achievement Award from the Cobequid Arts Council the same year.{{sfnmp|Splash Magazines|2022|Visual Arts Nova Scotia|2014}}

